X: 1
T: Little Shop of Horrors
O: Alan Menken, 1982
N: The title song (the show's Prologue). Melody is the top voice of the piano
N: reduction in a hamienet.com MIDI (id 7926), corroborated bar for bar by a second
N: arrangement there (id 21233); chords fitted from their accompaniment. Key and
N: octave as in the source (C minor, D4 to G5). The chant section is written as its
N: two-bar unit in repeat marks; the source repeats it five times. Its B and E are
N: naturals over the G-major harmony.
